{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Circulating ISO 4217 currencies. 'exponent' = number of minor-unit digits: every *_cents amount in the API is an integer in minor units of its currency (10^exponent minor units = 1 major unit). Shared by the backend (backend/app/core/data/currencies.json is a byte-identical copy) and the frontend.",
  "notes": [
    "IDR is treated as 0 dp (no subunit is used in practice); ISO 4217 lists 2.",
    "Fund/precious-metal codes (CLF, UYI, XAU, XDR, ...) and withdrawn currencies are not included."
